          "definition": "CREATE FUNCTION `order_total`(oid INT) RETURNS decimal(10,2)\n    READS SQL DATA\nBEGIN\n  DECLARE t DECIMAL(10,2);\n  SELECT total INTO t FROM orders WHERE id = oid;\n  RETURN t;\nEND"
